    "detailed_description": "<h1>OUR NEW GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is SokoChess?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SokoChess is a minimalistic puzzle game that combines Chess with the Sokoban block-pushing formula. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal of each level is to push black pieces to predetermined positions while making sure they don't capture all your pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Push the black pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f5cd5f3611bab58da77de4ce153c56d6.poster.avif?t=1745739764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f5cd5f3611bab58da77de4ce153c56d6.webm?t=1745739764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f5cd5f3611bab58da77de4ce153c56d6.mp4?t=1745739764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The goal of each level is to push all the black pieces to their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Careful where you move</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/58b95d2fb5f6958b9c3a50f4b4ebf585.poster.avif?t=1745739764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/58b95d2fb5f6958b9c3a50f4b4ebf585.webm?t=1745739764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/58b95d2fb5f6958b9c3a50f4b4ebf585.mp4?t=1745739764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The black pieces will only move if you give them an opportunity to capture one of your pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f07a4af4500ac67319d6dfaa42a53ebc.avif?t=1745739764\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 70 levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Infinite undos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Don't like a level you are playing? Skip it </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Puzzle elements you won't see in Chess </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique gameplay combining Chess and Sokoban </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What is SokoChess?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SokoChess is a minimalistic puzzle game that combines Chess with the Sokoban block-pushing formula. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The goal of each level is to push black pieces to predetermined positions while making sure they don't capture all your pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Push the black pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f5cd5f3611bab58da77de4ce153c56d6.poster.avif?t=1745739764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f5cd5f3611bab58da77de4ce153c56d6.webm?t=1745739764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f5cd5f3611bab58da77de4ce153c56d6.mp4?t=1745739764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The goal of each level is to push all the black pieces to their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Careful where you move</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/58b95d2fb5f6958b9c3a50f4b4ebf585.poster.avif?t=1745739764\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/58b95d2fb5f6958b9c3a50f4b4ebf585.webm?t=1745739764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/58b95d2fb5f6958b9c3a50f4b4ebf585.mp4?t=1745739764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>The black pieces will only move if you give them an opportunity to capture one of your pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f07a4af4500ac67319d6dfaa42a53ebc.avif?t=1745739764\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 70 levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Infinite undos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Don't like a level you are playing? Skip it </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Puzzle elements you won't see in Chess </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Unique gameplay combining Chess and Sokoban </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "SokoChess is a minimalistic puzzle game about pushing chess pieces. Use your pieces to push the black figures to their destination, but be careful! The opposing pieces will capture yours if you give them the chance!",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Latin America, Czech, Polish, French, German, Simplified Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cSokoChess is an intriguing puzzle game that combines chess pieces and their respective movements with Sokoban in a complex way.\u201d<br>Life is Xbox<br><br>\u201cEver wanted to enhance the game of Chess with new elements? That\u2019s where SokoChess comes in.\u201d<br>Linux Gaming Central<br><br>\u201cThe levels have a unique design, each one takes advantage of the mechanics that the title offers so as not to make it a repetitive experience.\u201d<br>Guardado R\u00e1pido<br>",
